Relationship:

For each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;hasOutput’ on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.

For each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;hasInput’ on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
